---
title: Give Now
description: Make your gift to the Rocket Fund — online, by phone, by mail, or automatically with GameChange.
sidearmSlug: give-now
cleanUrl: utrockets.com/givenow
crumb: []
---
{% from "components.njk" import hero, sechead, ctaband %}

{% call hero("Make your gift", "Give Now", "Every dollar fuels a Toledo student-athlete. Choose the way that works for you.", true) %}
<div class="rkt-btnrow">
  <a class="rkt-btn" href="{{ site.giveUrl }}">Give online</a>
</div>
{% endcall %}

<section class="rkt-section">
  <div class="rkt-wrap">
    {{ sechead("Four ways to give", "Choose your launch method") }}
    <ul class="rkt-channels">
      <li class="rkt-channel rkt-reveal">
        <h3 class="rkt-h3">Online</h3>
        <p>The fastest way to give. Make a one-time or recurring gift through the university's secure giving form.</p>
        <a class="rkt-btn rkt-btn--ghost-light" style="margin-top:1rem" href="{{ site.giveUrl }}">Give online</a>
      </li>
      <li class="rkt-channel rkt-reveal">
        <h3 class="rkt-h3">By phone</h3>
        <p>Call the Athletic Development Office and our team will take care of the rest.</p>
        <span class="rkt-mono"><a href="tel:+14195302510">419.530.2510</a></span>
        <span class="rkt-mono"><a href="tel:+14195304183">419.530.4183</a></span>
      </li>
      <li class="rkt-channel rkt-reveal">
        <h3 class="rkt-h3">By mail</h3>
        <p>Make checks payable to the UToledo Foundation, memo "Rocket Fund."</p>
        <span class="rkt-mono">Athletic Development Office<br>2801 West Bancroft Street MS 302<br>Toledo, OH 43606</span>
      </li>
      <li class="rkt-channel rkt-reveal">
        <h3 class="rkt-h3">Automatically</h3>
        <p>Enroll a card with GameChange and every purchase rounds up to fuel the Rockets — no effort required.</p>
        <a class="rkt-btn rkt-btn--ghost-light" style="margin-top:1rem" href="/ways-to-give/gamechange/">How GameChange works</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
    {% if site.giveUrlIsPlaceholder %}
    <p class="rkt-note">Preview note: the online giving button currently points to a placeholder destination. It will link to the official UToledo Foundation giving form before launch.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

{{ ctaband("Giving $100 or more? Benefits start here.", "/benefits/", "See your benefits", "/faq/", "Read the FAQ") }}
